flowchart TD
  APP[Mobile / web] --> GW[API gateway]
  GW -- search nearby --> LBS[Location search service<br/>stateless · read-only]
  GW -- create / update business --> BIZ[Business service]
  LBS --> GI[(Geo index replicas<br/>geohash → business ids<br/>in memory / Redis)]
  LBS --> BC[(Business details cache)]
  BIZ --> DB[(Business DB<br/>primary + replicas)]
  DB -- change events / nightly rebuild --> GI
  BC -. miss .-> DB
